{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Letter to the Distant Unknown</strong>  <br>Write a letter and send it into the unknown. One day, you may receive a sincere reply from a stranger, or discover a warm story hidden in their words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate Your Cozy Nest</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change different wallpapers, floors, furniture, and wall decorations to arrange your ideal 2D cozy nest. Whether it's a warm wooden cottage or a vibrant colorful space, you can fill it with stories using furniture, lighting, and decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/d1797716daec2d2ba8dd2603921e79f2.poster.avif?t=1756101105\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/d1797716daec2d2ba8dd2603921e79f2.webm?t=1756101105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/d1797716daec2d2ba8dd2603921e79f2.mp4?t=1756101105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show Off Your Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide range of customizable options like fashion, hairstyles, colors, and room decorations to create the look you love. From cat ears to ponytails, from long dresses to bikinis, from princess outfits to maid outfits, numerous options allow you to express your unique personality and taste. The game supports MOD expansions for clothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/cb0686b43f646fa7409ec89a5ced9170.poster.avif?t=1756101105\" width=780 height=363 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/cb0686b43f646fa7409ec89a5ced9170.mp4?t=1756101105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Personal Soundscape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy carefully selected tracks; also featuring 30+ white noises like ocean waves, rain, fireplace, and birdsong, ensuring you find the perfect sound for every work session, study time, or moment of relaxation. Supports adding MOD expansions, infinitely extending your sound world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flow Tools</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus efficiently with Miyuuri by your side: Pomodoro timer, habit tracker, priority task notes, calendar... helping you achieve your daily goals in a cozy atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831230?t=1756101105","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831230?t=1756101105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/ab68649d3dd01cbb324ef515a94fe90e2710c59c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756101105","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/ab68649d3dd01cbb324ef515a94fe90e2710c59c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756101105","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Letter to the Distant Unknown</strong>  <br>Write a letter and send it into the unknown. One day, you may receive a sincere reply from a stranger, or discover a warm story hidden in their words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate Your Cozy Nest</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change different wallpapers, floors, furniture, and wall decorations to arrange your ideal 2D cozy nest. Whether it's a warm wooden cottage or a vibrant colorful space, you can fill it with stories using furniture, lighting, and decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/d1797716daec2d2ba8dd2603921e79f2.poster.avif?t=1756101105\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/d1797716daec2d2ba8dd2603921e79f2.webm?t=1756101105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/d1797716daec2d2ba8dd2603921e79f2.mp4?t=1756101105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show Off Your Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide range of customizable options like fashion, hairstyles, colors, and room decorations to create the look you love. From cat ears to ponytails, from long dresses to bikinis, from princess outfits to maid outfits, numerous options allow you to express your unique personality and taste. The game supports MOD expansions for clothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://sha